# AI Student Performance Predictor

An AI-powered Student Performance Predictor built using Python, Machine Learning, and Streamlit.

## Features

- Predicts student final performance
- Uses attendance, study hours, assignment marks, mid marks, and previous GPA
- Displays student profile and academic information
- Provides personalized suggestions
- Interactive Streamlit web interface
- Machine learning model using Random Forest

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Streamlit
- Matplotlib
- Joblib

## How to Run

Install the required packages:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Run the application:

python -m streamlit run app.py

## Dataset

The project uses a synthetic student dataset for demonstration purposes.

